"description": "Read and build a CloudCrane workspace over MCP: its datasets, the contracts that define what each field may say, what is waiting for review, and the receipt behind any value. A key made to build can also create datasets, fields and value sets, start runs, publish a release when the accuracy gate passes by itself, and deploy it: a tool, its keys, and the scenarios that guard its releases. Sign in with a CloudCrane account (OAuth), where a workspace owner approves the app, or with a build key an owner creates. On every plan. Publishing past the accuracy gate, changing a safety field so a value could go missing, and resolving a review item stay with a person, because a receipt names who decided: an agent asks with request_approval, and a person approves. Editing a stored value, withholding a record and deleting are a person's alone.",
